---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import AboutPhoto from './AboutPhoto.astro';
import AboutClosing from './AboutClosing.astro';
import DisclosureAnchors from './DisclosureAnchors.astro';
import {companyFacts,companyHistory,applications} from '../data/company';
import AboutCredentials from './AboutCredentials.astro';
import '../styles/about-redesign.css';
const primaryApplications=applications.filter(item=>['Laboratory & scientific instruments','Automotive & motorcycle prototypes','Robotics & automation','Electronic & audio equipment'].includes(item.title));
const otherApplications=applications.filter(item=>!primaryApplications.includes(item));
---
 <Layout title="LZZ Precision: CNC machining company in Hangzhou" description="Meet Hangzhou Lizhizao Precision Machinery Co., Ltd. Review its workshop, engineering experience, company recognition documents and supplier qualification requirements." cta={false}>
 <article class="al-page al-profile"><DisclosureAnchors/><div class="al-wrap">
  <header class="al-hero al-profile-lead"><h1>LZZ Precision<br/>in Hangzhou</h1><p class="al-legal-name">Hangzhou Lizhizao Precision Machinery Co., Ltd.</p><div class="al-profile-intro"><div><p class="al-lead">We make custom CNC machined components for equipment assemblies, from an initial part to repeat production. Milling, turning and multi-axis work are reviewed against the drawing, material and acceptance requirements.</p><a class="al-inline-link" href="#documents">View company recognition &amp; documents</a><dl class="al-facts">{companyFacts.map(fact=><div><dt>{fact.label}</dt><dd>{fact.value}</dd></div>)}</dl></div><AboutPhoto id="workshop-wide" caption="Machining centers in the LZZ workshop" eager/></div></header>
  <section class="al-section" id="company-overview"><header class="al-section-head"><h2>Engineering experience, with inspection planned for your part</h2><p>Our engineering team has more than 15 years of CNC machining experience. We review the functional surfaces, locating datums and tool access before agreeing the machining and inspection scope.</p></header><div class="al-profile-intro"><div><h3>Milling, turning and multi-axis work</h3><p>Parts may combine pockets and mounting features with bores, shoulders or threads. The model and controlled drawing determine the machining route and the dimensions to check.</p><nav class="al-actions" aria-label="Machining and inspection"><a class="al-inline-link" href="/capabilities/">Explore machining capabilities</a><a class="al-inline-link" href="/factory/#quality">Review inspection planning</a></nav></div><div id="company-factory"><AboutPhoto id="workshop-aisle" caption="The production floor at LZZ"/></div></div></section>
  <AboutCredentials/>
  <section class="al-section" aria-labelledby="people-heading"><header class="al-section-head"><h2 id="people-heading">Talk through the part, close to the workshop</h2><p>A workshop visit can connect the drawing discussion with the machining environment. The January 2025 visit photographs show a component discussion and the production floor.</p></header><div class="al-people"><div><AboutPhoto id="visitor-part-discussion" caption="Part discussion · January 2025"/><a class="al-inline-link" href="/about/company-news/australian-customer-workshop-visit-january-2025/">Read the workshop visit record</a></div><div><div class="al-people-copy"><h3>The people behind the work</h3><p>The company archive also records days outside the workshop with the LZZ team.</p></div><AboutPhoto id="team-2025-evening-group" caption="An evening group photograph · May 2025"/><a class="al-inline-link" href="/about/company-news/may-2025-lzz-team-outing/">See the team outing</a></div></div></section>
  <section class="al-section al-history" id="company-history"><span id="company-network"/><div><h2>From the first parts to a broader machining scope</h2><p>LZZ began in 2017, making precision CNC machined parts for domestic equipment manufacturers.</p></div><ol class="al-timeline">{companyHistory.map(item=><li><h3>{item.title}</h3><p>{item.text}</p></li>)}</ol></section>
  <section class="al-section" id="applications"><span id="part-studies"/><header class="al-section-head"><h2>Components for equipment assemblies</h2><p>Use these application families to discuss a similar component. The drawing and project requirements define the actual machining, traceability and approval scope.</p></header><div class="al-application-list">{primaryApplications.map(item=><article><h3>{item.title}</h3><p>{item.description}</p><a class="al-inline-link" href={item.href}>{item.label}</a></article>)}</div><details class="al-more-applications"><summary>More application families to discuss</summary><div class="al-application-list">{otherApplications.map(item=><article><h3>{item.title}</h3><p>{item.description}</p><a class="al-inline-link" href={item.href}>{item.label}</a></article>)}</div></details></section>
  <AboutClosing title="Discuss the requirements for your component"/>
 </div></article>
</Layout>
<script is:inline>const legacyAboutDestinations={'company-archive':'/about/company-news/','contact':'/about/contact/'};const moveLegacyAboutLink=()=>{const destination=legacyAboutDestinations[location.hash.slice(1)];if(destination)location.replace(destination);};moveLegacyAboutLink();window.addEventListener('hashchange',moveLegacyAboutLink);</script>
